+---
 
-`remat_indexed_acc_safe` (`src/backend/generation.rs`) is arch-agnostic but
-hard-coded `pushq %rax` / `popq %rax`, which the AArch64/RISC-V assemblers
-reject ("unsupported instruction: pushq %rax") — `lccc-arm -O0` could not
